  <section className="dashboard-hero"><div className="dashboard-hero-copy"><div className="dashboard-greeting"><span className="greeting-spark"><Sparkles size={14}/></span>Welcome to your organization workspace {isMock&&<span className="sample-pill">Demo workspace</span>}</div><h1>Build your team around <em>what they can do.</em></h1><p>Review skill-first matches, move roles forward, and keep candidate identity private until consent.</p><Link className="button accent dashboard-primary" to="/jobs/new"><Plus size={17}/>Create a role <ArrowRight size={16}/></Link></div><div className="dashboard-art" aria-hidden="true"><div className="art-orbit orbit-a"/><div className="art-orbit orbit-b"/><div className="art-center"><Users size={25}/><span>Skill-first</span></div><div className="art-float art-float-top"><BadgeCheck size={15}/><span>Verified skills</span></div><div className="art-float art-float-bottom"><LockKeyhole size={14}/><span>Blind by default</span></div><span className="art-dot art-dot-one"/><span className="art-dot art-dot-two"/></div></section>
